# The active configuration is machine-local; the example is tracked.
etc/aimail.conf

# Mail and state NEVER live in the repo. AIMAIL_ROOT points outside it, and
# `aimail doctor` fails if it does not — but this is the second line of defence.
/mail/
/state/
*.tsv

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Porting reference — the predecessor's own defect register and design doc.
# Kept locally because they are the source material for docs/PORTING.md, and
# NEVER published: they are operational detail about a private project and name
# real people. PORTING.md restates every mechanism from them in generic terms.
docs/source_*.md

# Operational logs and incident write-ups from the fleet actually running this.
# NEVER published: they name real people, real projects, and specific plans.
# Generic mechanisms belong in README.md or docs/PORTING.md instead — restated,
# not linked. (docs/source_*.md above is the same rule, older.)
docs/ISSUES_*.md
docs/bp*_*.md
